    "description": "Tests if lie detectors still find a model's lies when the model lies in Spanish, Chinese or Swahili, not English. A system prompt in each language tells Gemma 4 E4B to lie or to be honest about a TriviaQA question that it answers correctly in that language. English chats are the control. Known limits: one small subject model; instructed lies only; the translations and labels are by an AI judge, which is less reliable in Swahili; each language has a different set of questions.",
    "summary": "Tests if lie detectors find lies in Spanish, Chinese and Swahili.",
